# Flow State: "If there is an instant card and a sorcery card in YOUR graveyard". Bot2's graveyard holds a Lightning Bolt
# (instant) and a Chain Lightning (sorcery) but Bot1's is empty, so Bot1 puts only one of the three cards into hand,
# the Island, and the other two go to the bottom (the other scenarios, with both in Bot1's own graveyard, take two).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Island
Flow State
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Ornithopter
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Chain Lightning
Mountain x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Chain Lightning.Cast(Bot1)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Flow State.Cast
Bot1.Arrange(Mox Jet | Ornithopter; Mox Ruby)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Chain Lightning; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Graveyard = Flow State
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Mox Jet
